  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Autres op&#xe9;rations du HCR en Afrique (2023)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Other UNHCR operations in Africa (2023)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Cette activit&#xe9; montre les d&#xe9;tails des activiti&#xe9;s r&#xe9;gionales du HCR dans l&apos;Est et Corne de l&apos;Afrique pour 2023 et les ann&#xe9;es &#xe0; venir, y compris le budget, les financements et les d&#xe9;penses.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity shows details of other UNHCR operations in the East and Horn of Africa for 2023 including the budget, funding and expenditure.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR&apos;s work is made possible by the generosity of its donors, including dozens of governments, hundreds of companies and their employees, and millions of private individuals who give directly or through UNHCR&apos;s National Partners.

The activities of the Other UNHCR operations in Africa are governed by the Financial Rules for Voluntary Funds Administered by the High Commissioner for Refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le HCR, l&apos;Agence des Nations Unies pour les r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, est une organisation internationale qui a pour mission de sauver des vies, de prot&#xe9;ger les droits des r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s et de construire un avenir meilleur pour les r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, les communaut&#xe9;s d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es et les apatrides.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNHCR, the UN Refugee Agency, is a global organisation dedicated to saving lives, protecting rights and building a better future for refugees, forcibly displaced communities and stateless people.</narrative>
  </description>
